  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistant for the Digital Transitioning Programme for Jamaica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives (Outcomes) of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective (Outcome) 1&lt;/strong&gt;: To provide budget support management technical expertise and enhance the capacity of the Office of the Prime Minister (OPM) as well as the Planning Institute of Jamaica (PIOJ) to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7; &amp;nbsp;ensure the efficient implementation of the Digital Transitioning Programme for Jamaica (Digital Jamaica); and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ensure the efficient coordination, management and reporting of the overall programme.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective (Outcome) 2:&lt;/strong&gt; To support the communication of the results of Digital Jamaica to internal/external audiences. In particular, to inform main target groups about the involved Ministries contribution to the GOJ&#xbf;s wider Digital Transformation Agenda and the EU&#xbf;s contribution to these efforts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
